WEBVTT

1
00:00:14,930 --> 00:00:15,850
Why are you crying?

2
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:23,110
a wild boar

3
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:26,620
Almost cost you half your life, your leg

4
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:27,900
It's not a good idea to take it either

5
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,440
Then we have to talk more this night

6
